0.157 g
39.6850393700787407 221.1025984251967884 Td
(WILMS is a production-grade operational platform for managing women's interest-free group lending programmes. It) Tj
T* (digitises the complete lending lifecycle — borrower registration, document capture, loan approval, capital pool) Tj
T* (management, weekly field collections with GPS verification, headquarters reconciliation, expense tracking,) Tj
T* (multi-channel notifications, executive intelligence, and audit — within a single TypeScript monorepo deployed on) Tj
T* (Vercel with Neon PostgreSQL.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.157 g
39.6850393700787407 138.8978740157479024 Td
(The platform serves NGOs, government microfinance initiatives, and institutional partners operating interest-free loan) Tj
T* (programmes for women organised in community groups. WILMS enforces separation of duties through role-based) Tj
T* (access control \(RBAC\), maker-checker workflows on financial mutations, immutable audit logging, and integer) Tj
T* (pesewas money handling to eliminate floating-point errors.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 7 Tf
8.0499999999999989 TL
0.361 g
39.6850393700787407 22.6771653543306684 Td
(CONFIDENTIAL — For authorized WILMS personnel, executive review, procurement, and official record keeping only.) Tj
ET
