39.6850393700787407 493.2285826771653205 Td
(1. Financial integrity — Integer pesewas accounting, pool hard-stops, immutable payment records after day-end,) Tj
T* (admin fee enforcement before disbursement. 2. Operational control — RBAC with five production roles, permission) Tj
T* (overrides, force-logout, separation of duties on expenses and adjustments. 3. Field readiness — Collector offline) Tj
T* (queue, GPS capture, mobile-optimised field shell, same-day edit window for collections. 4. Executive visibility —) Tj
T* (Operational dashboard for task queues, executive intelligence for board KPIs, forecasting, and portfolio breakdown.) Tj
T* (5. Auditability — Append-only audit log, role-scoped report access, export confidentiality notices. 6. Deployment) Tj
T* (simplicity — Next.js monolith on Vercel, Neon serverless PostgreSQL, in-process domain API via Route Handlers.) Tj
ET
