(Part XIII — Programme FAQ and certification reference) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.157 g
39.6850393700787407 459.2128346456692611 Td
(Q: What money unit does WILMS use?) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.157 g
39.6850393700787407 433.7010236220471597 Td
(A: Integer pesewas. 100 pesewas = 1 GHS. No floating-point money arithmetic.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.157 g
39.6850393700787407 408.1892125984251152 Td
(Q: Is WILMS a general ledger?) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.157 g
39.6850393700787407 382.6774015748030706 Td
(A: No. Operational pool ledgers and payment journals only. Statutory GL deferred v2.0.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.157 g
39.6850393700787407 357.1655905511810261 Td
(Q: Does WILMS charge interest?) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.157 g
39.6850393700787407 331.6537795275589815 Td
(A: No. Interest-free product model. No interest accrual engine.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.157 g
39.6850393700787407 306.1419685039369369 Td
(Q: Can collectors record partial payments?) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.157 g
39.6850393700787407 280.6301574803148924 Td
(A: No. Full weekly instalment required. Business rule enforced at API level.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.157 g
39.6850393700787407 255.1183464566928478 Td
(Q: When do payments become immutable?) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.157 g
39.6850393700787407 229.6065354330708033 Td
(A: After organisation day-end boundary. Same-day edit window applies before that.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.157 g
39.6850393700787407 204.0947244094487587 Td
(Q: What auth system does WILMS use?) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.157 g
39.6850393700787407 178.5829133858267141 Td
(A: Custom HMAC-signed session cookies \(wilms_session\). Not Auth.js or JWT browser sessions.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.157 g
39.6850393700787407 153.0711023622046696 Td
(Q: Where did Export Center go in v1.7.3?) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.157 g
39.6850393700787407 127.559291338582625 Td
(A: Standalone /exports removed. Use contextual exports on reports, profiles, and executive views.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.157 g
39.6850393700787407 102.0474803149605805 Td
(Q: Is the export job API still available?) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.157 g
39.6850393700787407 76.5356692913385359 Td
(A: Yes. POST/GET /exports/jobs retained for embedded and programmatic flows.) Tj
ET
BT
