/F1 7 Tf
8.0499999999999989 TL
0.361 g
39.6850393700787407 785.1970866141732586 Td
(Q: How many production roles exist?) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.157 g
39.6850393700787407 759.6852755905511003 Td
(A: Five: Super Admin, Registration Officer, Collector, Approver, Auditor.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.157 g
39.6850393700787407 734.1734645669291695 Td
(Q: Can a collector approve their own expense?) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.157 g
39.6850393700787407 708.6616535433070112 Td
(A: No. Maker-checker requires a different user for approval.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.157 g
39.6850393700787407 683.1498425196850803 Td
(Q: What happens when pool capital is insufficient?) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.157 g
39.6850393700787407 657.6380314960629221 Td
(A: Hard-stop. Disbursement refused until replenishment increases available capital.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.157 g
39.6850393700787407 632.1262204724408775 Td
(Q: Are admin fees required before disbursement?) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.157 g
39.6850393700787407 606.614409448818833 Td
(A: Yes. System blocks disbursement until admin fee confirmed.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.157 g
39.6850393700787407 581.1025984251967884 Td
(Q: Do expenses reduce loan principal?) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.157 g
39.6850393700787407 555.5907874015747439 Td
(A: No. Expenses affect operating cash only.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.157 g
39.6850393700787407 530.0789763779526993 Td
(Q: How does offline collection work?) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.157 g
39.6850393700787407 504.5671653543306547 Td
(A: Collector offline queue in localStorage; FIFO replay on reconnect via sync module.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.157 g
39.6850393700787407 479.0553543307086102 Td
(Q: What database does WILMS use?) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.157 g
39.6850393700787407 453.5435433070865656 Td
(A: Neon PostgreSQL with Drizzle ORM.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.157 g
39.6850393700787407 428.0317322834645211 Td
(Q: Where does the API run in production?) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.157 g
39.6850393700787407 402.5199212598424765 Td
(A: In-process via Next.js Route Handlers at /api/wilms by default.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.157 g
39.6850393700787407 377.0081102362204319 Td
(Q: How are notifications dispatched on schedule?) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.157 g
39.6850393700787407 351.4962992125983874 Td
(A: Vercel Cron daily at 06:00 UTC via /api/cron/notifications.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.157 g
39.6850393700787407 325.9844881889763428 Td
(Q: Can audit log entries be deleted?) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.157 g
39.6850393700787407 300.4726771653542983 Td
(A: No. Append-only design. No user can delete audit entries.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.157 g
39.6850393700787407 274.9608661417322537 Td
(Q: What report size limit applies?) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.157 g
39.6850393700787407 249.4490551181102092 Td
(A: Oversized unpaginated report queries return HTTP 422 \(fail-closed\).) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.157 g
39.6850393700787407 223.9372440944881646 Td
(Q: Where is the Financial Engine documented?) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.157 g
39.6850393700787407 198.4254330708660063 Td
(A: documentation/books/FINANCIAL_ENGINE_BOOK.md) Tj
ET
